<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SUMMARY OF SPANISH SUPER CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SUMMARY OF SPANISH SUPER CUP.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of the Spanish Super Cup, second leg, played on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Atletico Madrid 3 (Juan Lopez 28th minute, Juan Esnaider 58th, Milinko Pantic 75th) Barcelona 1 (Hristo Stoichkov 55th).</p>
<p>Halftime 1-0. Attendance 11,000.</p>
<p>(Barcelona win 6-5 on aggregate).</p>
